e,"src":"Wikipedia","c":14},{"lap":13,"text":"However, he continued without losing his position until lap 13, when his pit crew taped the car back together, and dropped to thirteenth place.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":17},{"lap":26,"text":"On lap 26, Gurney, running in third place, did a 360\u00b0 spin and was overtaken by Surtees' Honda.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":3},{"lap":52,"text":"He then sent a message to the rest of the racers by posting the fastest lap of the race on lap 52, widening his lead to 31 seconds.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0},{"lap":97,"text":"On lap 97, a minute and twenty seconds ahead of Bruce McLaren, Jo Siffert's Lotus began to sputter, and he signaled to his pit that he would stop to refuel in the next round.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":4},{"lap":108,"text":"Three laps later, the nose on Andretti's Lotus was broken, with the right wing dragging on the ground.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":17},{"lap":108,"text":"Surtees used the opportunity catch up with Gurney's McLaren in the last lap, as they both finished a lap down to the leaders.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":2}]}